{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "3046c6a12737e348e16ae13cd1740c80041fed3325f67b4f74a062ceb9f95fc2",
  "bundle_request_count": 22,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:0994a6d01d984fa472435aee298261d84c9809aed492154726cde761d2c51648",
      "request_id": "0994a6d01d984fa472435aee298261d84c9809aed492154726cde761d2c51648",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9762b595b705d1653fc430c427a8c7b3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一晚，德米纳尔也倒下：六比七、三比六负埃切维里，停在三千一百七十分。门没换人——霍达尔守在三千二百三十四分上。最后一问：这是时代翻页了，还是三十九岁的身体，只坏了一个晚上？评论区，站队。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c4f1427cf8eda59c3f09ddfd13e31dbc910183080f5fa8efebec7f4f757f87fa",
      "words_sha256": "254cd2b385fb2d2def893d66787e92bab4e1e44fb380a0f04ceadd453e358b2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0a56f9dadea889e162964a38cfd0e0138f401e9932b5717dad3d9307bfcc8ad0",
      "request_id": "0a56f9dadea889e162964a38cfd0e0138f401e9932b5717dad3d9307bfcc8ad0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "12881de8928736d0adf6a03192947fca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "为什么第九名还算门里？因为辛纳的膝伤让他提前结束了赛季，八张票，顺延一位。前面四张早被锁定；科博利腿伤退赛，躺在三千六百八十分上。还悬着的，只剩最后一席，和一排追赶者。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0bee6b3d52a5e80e2b5ea6be31f138271633c1fae9b3151ebad682deeeb69c62",
      "words_sha256": "39fb2aa09e04f0de68bfe59070adc8ee357187e75be5ea25d68a60018e170d7b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:13eed40dcca9e8c07624cc5c3b7558c007de3e93d989b0436dd7c3c20aaaa622",
      "request_id": "13eed40dcca9e8c07624cc5c3b7558c007de3e93d989b0436dd7c3c20aaaa622",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a8380acbbebda22dd2bd6b274f897524",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上周日，他又刚拿下巴塞尔的冠军。到了巴黎，德约面前的，还是他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e806b90a86839c80c01b948fa8bf1b6d5070653305dc1e721acdc5101ea4d1d5",
      "words_sha256": "de430a7a8b85746a51e46b179d14a916666e3eac76fdd4c01b94e28bd67208ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:208bee0a85612be6b1950a064849ec07a91431156b6c8a98ee1539472ab385c3",
      "request_id": "208bee0a85612be6b1950a064849ec07a91431156b6c8a98ee1539472ab385c3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3987f2c0d2c5f26750069da48e2ccb59",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了周三。站在他对面的，叫土方凛辉，资格赛打上来的，世界第八十三。第一盘，德约打得像回家：两次破发，六比二，三十一分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c98d76cb2d9f24356a609ee5542c0459f2daa9459f0e5d216abbc748bfb30e39",
      "words_sha256": "8aee2cd41653b4e141e2f83b45b9a7f46be648485cc8483388819a68729c7d3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:21ee59e8e333d733123102ab2b329dc443c3e55db807fa63e9b91e21c2466f46",
      "request_id": "21ee59e8e333d733123102ab2b329dc443c3e55db807fa63e9b91e21c2466f46",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "379f3fad2c37ac707b30e54c9253219b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "还有一个人，也在等。德米纳尔——维也纳决赛输给了阿尔卡拉斯，他的账停在三千一百七十，进不进都灵，要看这一周别人的脸色。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7ba4e26714383e661c93cb27f8a8984901a2a750829328eb7840fe9f010fec63",
      "words_sha256": "8772f3ab80083e9f964ef31fb28f8d8c002336b6ba98335c3eee6042c398d99b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:23e2585feab77a00346eb535a348935df42d9b04d402a6b484ead8d1b5134760",
      "request_id": "23e2585feab77a00346eb535a348935df42d9b04d402a6b484ead8d1b5134760",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cd7d89d4e1026a65985c9a2a784848a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "整场算下来，德约的二发只赢下百分之三十四，五次双误，全堆在最要命的时段。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "857e2e1b2918f4baef27baa97e9d827186dd42aa8273cb02eef525a523eec87f",
      "words_sha256": "6fc48de6b73acfd9209d26b415b10fb6d9f2a39b16b40417ed7ebc3bf8531a30"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:262b1d602bc478aa4755501fdaeab03ac7994353467c94cf675b1c47c1378018",
      "request_id": "262b1d602bc478aa4755501fdaeab03ac7994353467c94cf675b1c47c1378018",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb372a5010805370845ce4a55d274626",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以第一晚对瓦舍罗，先丢一盘，又被拖进决胜盘——他硬是爬了回来，六比七、七比五、六比一。只是这一爬，代价是两小时四十七分钟；而门口那条线，一步都没有让。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "aa7961e7b4762fb5743c2899e26730740a19f8f379edb3ecccea7c4014505106",
      "words_sha256": "876ea8023d22c5ac876585d8a31a443ab420dd65906f0b62d8730565b9afc7a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3e6460f08ef908d28365d7b17b1d35184c9cf6e0eb2c276286a75237ba8fc5d6",
      "request_id": "3e6460f08ef908d28365d7b17b1d35184c9cf6e0eb2c276286a75237ba8fc5d6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b29cff6547802b6c4915f8e13825add7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一关，瓦舍罗。去年上海，世界排名二百零四、从资格赛打上来的瓦舍罗，在半决赛把德约淘汰出局，转身拿下了冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5d1aee0f2817be7926018800d80ebecde8faab8c95620e2b8112221c1c2515a2",
      "words_sha256": "eb0f006519bd0d2480d83bbe78d164829b110f990dd6809e3df3b9107d1b27b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3f9cdbd51df88591c5cae6c30f1ae8db3067e61f75bf90b2a1de70cf09100e53",
      "request_id": "3f9cdbd51df88591c5cae6c30f1ae8db3067e61f75bf90b2a1de70cf09100e53",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "75ee1152411a3cdf7615dedfff739f40",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘，三比三，德约的发球局先丢了。这是两人第三次交手，前两次他都是直落两盘——可这一次，三十九岁的腿，追不上二十五岁的正手了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "cd0050e390eeb4ccabf529b6ef0aa447773c648b3750025b7961baf0d8d8db28",
      "words_sha256": "feb138d41e81f3070a25aebe5959241113e97f507a0544a7a0ec9a7734f5d234"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:51b1eb2cb1dc9af8bce7830f4ad4c0b3e611bd36cf287890c550da38f5f40c74",
      "request_id": "51b1eb2cb1dc9af8bce7830f4ad4c0b3e611bd36cf287890c550da38f5f40c74",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb516b136c196b5a0dac06800585d623",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三比五，最后一局，又是两记双误，把赛点亲手送了出去。三十一分钟的第一盘，像一个完全不同的夜晚。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "540e553a683ca5544fd513c71d0cb696c41504691648c4d551bc8b84d1d55fd2",
      "words_sha256": "c3d1a3919f1e638939c4e72aa8bfa3643c718d4b3765db677b1ba17fab512ab6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5ad45d259d1e420bf18d909cd97a8ecee3dae675b7b4ef8c86e49881ed69645a",
      "request_id": "5ad45d259d1e420bf18d909cd97a8ecee3dae675b7b4ef8c86e49881ed69645a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7b6c0694642a7eabb12fa45e3c7ee505",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "都灵的门，只剩最后一张票。门内侧站着十九岁的霍达尔，门外排着一串拿过大师赛冠军的名字。十一月四号的巴黎之夜，最后一个走到门口的，是德约科维奇。赛后他说：『他几乎没有失误，把球压得很低——我让比赛的控制权溜走了。』这扇门，他到底是怎么没进去的？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a930226f4e616b9676347901589397a0c712f1dff5a1316e0ede28c0acfa7ac5",
      "words_sha256": "0d51decb6a12e39b6b1a667487462b2c0ace22058b34d11276800cd348d8600f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:76e0b326a2ea1f2a81d2191b597d39ba8b3086da79d792ef4e8ac79e2d29a8f3",
      "request_id": "76e0b326a2ea1f2a81d2191b597d39ba8b3086da79d792ef4e8ac79e2d29a8f3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "61cc2c617f137598885a90e0761b817c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赛后他说：『他几乎没有失误，把球压得很低——我让比赛的控制权溜走了。』",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b5a9cf6e67b42565e97392b904bdcd0256cf725af138cdb5466a31a626dec16c",
      "words_sha256": "c7cb7d28245a01a541a377ac2c1423bc3643b471a1452329cbd17f6682f6b036"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:905b633bb93574f45797d809c4e738c35c0a0294f922234b6815b21adc034acc",
      "request_id": "905b633bb93574f45797d809c4e738c35c0a0294f922234b6815b21adc034acc",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "72e3f7f472b1175a394542c7d943b439",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "都灵的门，他这次为什么没进去？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "166f234f0f5912d20cbf279c3e044c84bf6298efa0ee89bca532226e9bfc6aa3",
      "words_sha256": "784d4b9e427e8ffa5a39b05669b187152477d0852530539fc191240a82a49a48"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:97123ca2e954de9491acac5acf3e9da63cb777ef4e80538b54954bcc6e9ba003",
      "request_id": "97123ca2e954de9491acac5acf3e9da63cb777ef4e80538b54954bcc6e9ba003",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "36772455a4799e239e3537de8654386b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再说回那扇门。周一亲手把门推开一条缝的霍达尔，周二迎面撞上鲁德。这位挪威人今年状态平平，却在最要命的夜里，打出了整年最稳的一场球。守门人自己，先倒下了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "05a436c90c05b58d146241a0b2f7a431f3f0bbe3caaf9144a7d6356d977d7223",
      "words_sha256": "119dc374ef3722b7265df4439dbacc183aadad01b2cb4fd826fdb6f61893fc17"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:98a65280637fa19fc21cb7dfb92b9e2c86b6b0640086ae165e8cf9f79fd2b766",
      "request_id": "98a65280637fa19fc21cb7dfb92b9e2c86b6b0640086ae165e8cf9f79fd2b766",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a6b1842d9c80ac7926dd6d256fd509bd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德约的账最难。两千九百分，从第一轮打起，至少打进半决赛才有机会，夺冠才稳妥。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f02437ddb428311dcd93badc7ee3f26fa75aebb0642969cf2b3d8b792e5d9bda",
      "words_sha256": "64bdd9b5bb3c63c3631fbcdd305eef7f9d35b9fc5301bf98e37a3a19558eb301"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9a28fc0db6f6c446c34cd5939733fc68589c79e0440b8f15c643f42a69c7026f",
      "request_id": "9a28fc0db6f6c446c34cd5939733fc68589c79e0440b8f15c643f42a69c7026f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "222a9778fef37c87d8a145ce3d01dc8f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "真正已经上岸的，是科博利——巴塞尔夺冠，提前锁定都灵，不用再看任何人的脸色。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7a879b99af28333d465e573b84bea218863de651d8343b91872f46f7bbdcc648",
      "words_sha256": "8f8217d95015dcb622047c92d940f883fd6e1a5664dfc8e8084abc41c0dfb2f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "742d6e49e1534ab8c67a69611f61ec569a192b91e76b8a1d58f3fdb91b4b2e0b",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cf1a66c47bb0afe7f6218a34592c77ff2f5ca9c4185d1850dde99118f43eacb3",
      "request_id": "cf1a66c47bb0afe7f6218a34592c77ff2f5ca9c4185d1850dde99118f43eacb3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6b702ad70cea5a2ce9aa4603dd3a043d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一分，要从上周说起。维也纳打完，积分榜第九和第十之间，只差一分：三千二百一十，对三千二百零九。十个月的赛季，最后一张门票，最后落在了一分上。一分是什么概念？大师赛首轮出局，值十分。一分，是这张表上最小的差距。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dc87329fbeb9e1d517c80031bac792e9483155fc05f70670832e67de0677ba67",
      "words_sha256": "374cc187de91ac5a3c6096ecd0efead0998647ac2a186ccf45b40387c749d043"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e917fac6ee3b9fa5cd264aa5f02bb8820389ee5bc22027d1fc79281eb1a2e820",
      "request_id": "e917fac6ee3b9fa5cd264aa5f02bb8820389ee5bc22027d1fc79281eb1a2e820",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1c6446be355ee9fb0c0ac7f19292940f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘第八局，土方凛辉专挑二发下手——破发，六比三，扳平。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "20dc87eaae4334ca44f4dfa74da0da9ff03748fa78befeaf50ff39a2a6c110c6",
      "words_sha256": "7bafe2bd71c186cab8011a7f56c61812e5e2208b7b8b6149bcfab1160f0285b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ea9b2ac973f2dd522cf08325bf239d305b7d68b4477ff8ecdf64c811111579a9",
      "request_id": "ea9b2ac973f2dd522cf08325bf239d305b7d68b4477ff8ecdf64c811111579a9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "963e0e93deb8f17680be4637704aa9ca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴黎本该是他的福地——七座冠军，历史第一；可他上一次在这里打球，还是二零二三年。三十九岁回到巴黎，第一场，就是决战。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f2cabf26306fc2786cbbafdc42037c82680732a0daa2707144e38821251fd88d",
      "words_sha256": "62b5c72ca467b2d31d4c963e1795896c2cf259d482326d867c800800f48fe53b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ef35f36391a490daa34b51a9764c80befc712efa2e05aea95d1ba3c9b6cf9278",
      "request_id": "ef35f36391a490daa34b51a9764c80befc712efa2e05aea95d1ba3c9b6cf9278",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a2413bca16aed19c0bd95a67c3e3f1af",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "周一，守门人换了。霍达尔在巴黎首轮六比二、六比三赢下塔比洛，净赚二十五分，反超六十四分。三千二百三十四——轮到二十岁的他，站在门里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "71b3213edd5b25fa29774e43d0998eecffbdb39612b182169a16c671c03fb18f",
      "words_sha256": "425408279df7f8ae77d29b40de9db3f5b65a736f6ac6a28265d943a88dbec7a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fe8a2ece09ae416fc2c1ef66868a1e03b542b8cfa1a0a94eaf3bab455299b979",
      "request_id": "fe8a2ece09ae416fc2c1ef66868a1e03b542b8cfa1a0a94eaf3bab455299b979",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "71d99cd2bc33daa88d31c1d567689f5c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "门里这位，值得多看一眼。霍达尔，十九岁，西班牙人。一个月前在上海，他赢了梅德韦杰夫、打进决赛，这个名字才被记住。他守的这条线，是自己一场一场打出来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d4bdd34410edfaf9622c062b732724e3b9244fbd7a8bf854b0fd09285d25bbac",
      "words_sha256": "60e6f0c7dc81246ac8311c75472e574f21f38e119a0dfa81f2e1cc14f56cc7cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a930226f4e616b9676347901589397a0c712f1dff5a1316e0ede28c0acfa7ac5",
      "words_sha256": "0d51decb6a12e39b6b1a667487462b2c0ace22058b34d11276800cd348d8600f",
      "words_path": "voice_00.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7b6c0694642a7eabb12fa45e3c7ee505",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "都灵的门，只剩最后一张票。门内侧站着十九岁的霍达尔，门外排着一串拿过大师赛冠军的名字。十一月四号的巴黎之夜，最后一个走到门口的，是德约科维奇。赛后他说：『他几乎没有失误，把球压得很低——我让比赛的控制权溜走了。』这扇门，他到底是怎么没进去的？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dc87329fbeb9e1d517c80031bac792e9483155fc05f70670832e67de0677ba67",
      "words_sha256": "374cc187de91ac5a3c6096ecd0efead0998647ac2a186ccf45b40387c749d043",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6b702ad70cea5a2ce9aa4603dd3a043d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一分，要从上周说起。维也纳打完，积分榜第九和第十之间，只差一分：三千二百一十，对三千二百零九。十个月的赛季，最后一张门票，最后落在了一分上。一分是什么概念？大师赛首轮出局，值十分。一分，是这张表上最小的差距。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "71b3213edd5b25fa29774e43d0998eecffbdb39612b182169a16c671c03fb18f",
      "words_sha256": "425408279df7f8ae77d29b40de9db3f5b65a736f6ac6a28265d943a88dbec7a4",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a2413bca16aed19c0bd95a67c3e3f1af",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "周一，守门人换了。霍达尔在巴黎首轮六比二、六比三赢下塔比洛，净赚二十五分，反超六十四分。三千二百三十四——轮到二十岁的他，站在门里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0bee6b3d52a5e80e2b5ea6be31f138271633c1fae9b3151ebad682deeeb69c62",
      "words_sha256": "39fb2aa09e04f0de68bfe59070adc8ee357187e75be5ea25d68a60018e170d7b",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "12881de8928736d0adf6a03192947fca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "为什么第九名还算门里？因为辛纳的膝伤让他提前结束了赛季，八张票，顺延一位。前面四张早被锁定；科博利腿伤退赛，躺在三千六百八十分上。还悬着的，只剩最后一席，和一排追赶者。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7a879b99af28333d465e573b84bea218863de651d8343b91872f46f7bbdcc648",
      "words_sha256": "8f8217d95015dcb622047c92d940f883fd6e1a5664dfc8e8084abc41c0dfb2f7",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "222a9778fef37c87d8a145ce3d01dc8f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "真正已经上岸的，是科博利——巴塞尔夺冠，提前锁定都灵，不用再看任何人的脸色。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f02437ddb428311dcd93badc7ee3f26fa75aebb0642969cf2b3d8b792e5d9bda",
      "words_sha256": "64bdd9b5bb3c63c3631fbcdd305eef7f9d35b9fc5301bf98e37a3a19558eb301",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a6b1842d9c80ac7926dd6d256fd509bd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德约的账最难。两千九百分，从第一轮打起，至少打进半决赛才有机会，夺冠才稳妥。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f2cabf26306fc2786cbbafdc42037c82680732a0daa2707144e38821251fd88d",
      "words_sha256": "62b5c72ca467b2d31d4c963e1795896c2cf259d482326d867c800800f48fe53b",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "963e0e93deb8f17680be4637704aa9ca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴黎本该是他的福地——七座冠军，历史第一；可他上一次在这里打球，还是二零二三年。三十九岁回到巴黎，第一场，就是决战。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5d1aee0f2817be7926018800d80ebecde8faab8c95620e2b8112221c1c2515a2",
      "words_sha256": "eb0f006519bd0d2480d83bbe78d164829b110f990dd6809e3df3b9107d1b27b9",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b29cff6547802b6c4915f8e13825add7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第一关，瓦舍罗。去年上海，世界排名二百零四、从资格赛打上来的瓦舍罗，在半决赛把德约淘汰出局，转身拿下了冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e806b90a86839c80c01b948fa8bf1b6d5070653305dc1e721acdc5101ea4d1d5",
      "words_sha256": "de430a7a8b85746a51e46b179d14a916666e3eac76fdd4c01b94e28bd67208ba",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a8380acbbebda22dd2bd6b274f897524",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上周日，他又刚拿下巴塞尔的冠军。到了巴黎，德约面前的，还是他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d4bdd34410edfaf9622c062b732724e3b9244fbd7a8bf854b0fd09285d25bbac",
      "words_sha256": "60e6f0c7dc81246ac8311c75472e574f21f38e119a0dfa81f2e1cc14f56cc7cb",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "71d99cd2bc33daa88d31c1d567689f5c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "门里这位，值得多看一眼。霍达尔，十九岁，西班牙人。一个月前在上海，他赢了梅德韦杰夫、打进决赛，这个名字才被记住。他守的这条线，是自己一场一场打出来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7ba4e26714383e661c93cb27f8a8984901a2a750829328eb7840fe9f010fec63",
      "words_sha256": "8772f3ab80083e9f964ef31fb28f8d8c002336b6ba98335c3eee6042c398d99b",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "379f3fad2c37ac707b30e54c9253219b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "还有一个人，也在等。德米纳尔——维也纳决赛输给了阿尔卡拉斯，他的账停在三千一百七十，进不进都灵，要看这一周别人的脸色。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "aa7961e7b4762fb5743c2899e26730740a19f8f379edb3ecccea7c4014505106",
      "words_sha256": "876ea8023d22c5ac876585d8a31a443ab420dd65906f0b62d8730565b9afc7a1",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bb372a5010805370845ce4a55d274626",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以第一晚对瓦舍罗，先丢一盘，又被拖进决胜盘——他硬是爬了回来，六比七、七比五、六比一。只是这一爬，代价是两小时四十七分钟；而门口那条线，一步都没有让。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "05a436c90c05b58d146241a0b2f7a431f3f0bbe3caaf9144a7d6356d977d7223",
      "words_sha256": "119dc374ef3722b7265df4439dbacc183aadad01b2cb4fd826fdb6f61893fc17",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "36772455a4799e239e3537de8654386b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "再说回那扇门。周一亲手把门推开一条缝的霍达尔，周二迎面撞上鲁德。这位挪威人今年状态平平，却在最要命的夜里，打出了整年最稳的一场球。守门人自己，先倒下了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c98d76cb2d9f24356a609ee5542c0459f2daa9459f0e5d216abbc748bfb30e39",
      "words_sha256": "8aee2cd41653b4e141e2f83b45b9a7f46be648485cc8483388819a68729c7d3a",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3987f2c0d2c5f26750069da48e2ccb59",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了周三。站在他对面的，叫土方凛辉，资格赛打上来的，世界第八十三。第一盘，德约打得像回家：两次破发，六比二，三十一分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "20dc87eaae4334ca44f4dfa74da0da9ff03748fa78befeaf50ff39a2a6c110c6",
      "words_sha256": "7bafe2bd71c186cab8011a7f56c61812e5e2208b7b8b6149bcfab1160f0285b0",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1c6446be355ee9fb0c0ac7f19292940f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘第八局，土方凛辉专挑二发下手——破发，六比三，扳平。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "857e2e1b2918f4baef27baa97e9d827186dd42aa8273cb02eef525a523eec87f",
      "words_sha256": "6fc48de6b73acfd9209d26b415b10fb6d9f2a39b16b40417ed7ebc3bf8531a30",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cd7d89d4e1026a65985c9a2a784848a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "整场算下来，德约的二发只赢下百分之三十四，五次双误，全堆在最要命的时段。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cd0050e390eeb4ccabf529b6ef0aa447773c648b3750025b7961baf0d8d8db28",
      "words_sha256": "feb138d41e81f3070a25aebe5959241113e97f507a0544a7a0ec9a7734f5d234",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "75ee1152411a3cdf7615dedfff739f40",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘，三比三，德约的发球局先丢了。这是两人第三次交手，前两次他都是直落两盘——可这一次，三十九岁的腿，追不上二十五岁的正手了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "540e553a683ca5544fd513c71d0cb696c41504691648c4d551bc8b84d1d55fd2",
      "words_sha256": "c3d1a3919f1e638939c4e72aa8bfa3643c718d4b3765db677b1ba17fab512ab6",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb516b136c196b5a0dac06800585d623",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三比五，最后一局，又是两记双误，把赛点亲手送了出去。三十一分钟的第一盘，像一个完全不同的夜晚。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b5a9cf6e67b42565e97392b904bdcd0256cf725af138cdb5466a31a626dec16c",
      "words_sha256": "c7cb7d28245a01a541a377ac2c1423bc3643b471a1452329cbd17f6682f6b036",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "61cc2c617f137598885a90e0761b817c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赛后他说：『他几乎没有失误，把球压得很低——我让比赛的控制权溜走了。』",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c4f1427cf8eda59c3f09ddfd13e31dbc910183080f5fa8efebec7f4f757f87fa",
      "words_sha256": "254cd2b385fb2d2def893d66787e92bab4e1e44fb380a0f04ceadd453e358b2a",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9762b595b705d1653fc430c427a8c7b3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一晚，德米纳尔也倒下：六比七、三比六负埃切维里，停在三千一百七十分。门没换人——霍达尔守在三千二百三十四分上。最后一问：这是时代翻页了，还是三十九岁的身体，只坏了一个晚上？评论区，站队。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "166f234f0f5912d20cbf279c3e044c84bf6298efa0ee89bca532226e9bfc6aa3",
      "words_sha256": "784d4b9e427e8ffa5a39b05669b187152477d0852530539fc191240a82a49a48",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "72e3f7f472b1175a394542c7d943b439",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
